    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like it's just going to \"pass\" though. that's the thing. the person who was capable, the person who actually mattered to the world... that person is dead. there's no \"rediscovering\" someone who was built on a foundation that just crumbled. it’s not just a bad phase, it's a total structural failure. i'm just staring at an empty shell now.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
